<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>HotNews — 中國，每一天。</title><description>Daily stories from China in technology, finance, sports, entertainment, lifestyle, science, travel and culture — for readers around the world.</description><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/</link><language>zh-TW</language><item><title>中國 C919：自製客機飛向更多天空</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260922-tech-c919/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260922-tech-c919/</guid><description>由中國商飛研製的窄體客機 C919，正從首批商業航線走向日益壯大的機隊。一起來看這款中國指標性客機的門道，以及搭起來是什麼感覺。</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>aviation</category><category>c919</category><category>manufacturing</category></item><item><title>中國電動車出口正在改寫全球汽車版圖</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260921-finance-ev-exports/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260921-finance-ev-exports/</guid><description>中國已是全球最大汽車出口國，領頭的是比亞迪、奇瑞與一票新興品牌的電動與插電混動車——這股浪潮正深刻影響各地的車價。</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>exports</category><category>economy</category></item><item><title>馬拉松熱：跑步如何成為中國人的週末儀式</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260920-sports-marathon-boom/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260920-sports-marathon-boom/</guid><description>從要抽籤才能參加的都市馬拉松，到山區的越野賽，數千萬中國跑者把週末賽事變成全民休閒。</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>marathon</category><category>running</category><category>fitness</category></item><item><title>強片與紀錄：中國動畫長大了</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260919-entertainment-chinese-animation/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260919-entertainment-chinese-animation/</guid><description>從《哪吒》系列的票房神話，到新一代工作室的崛起，中國動畫電影已成為國內票房的強權——並把目光投向海外觀眾。</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>animation</category><category>film</category><category>box-office</category></item><item><title>茶之國度愛上咖啡</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260918-lifestyle-coffee-culture/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260918-lifestyle-coffee-culture/</guid><description>中國如今坐擁全球最大的咖啡市場之一。從上海精品烘焙到 App 點單連鎖，咖啡已悄悄融入都市日常。</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>coffee</category><category>cities</category><category>daily-life</category></item><item><title>天宮：中國空間站上的生活與科學</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/science/20260917-science-tiangong/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/science/20260917-science-tiangong/</guid><description>三組太空人輪流常駐的天宮空間站，正進行數百項實驗——並向世界各國的科學載荷敞開艙門。</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>space</category><category>tiangong</category><category>research</category></item><item><title>以時速 350 公里看中國：實用高鐵指南</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/travel/20260916-travel-high-speed-rail/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/travel/20260916-travel-high-speed-rail/</guid><description>超過 4.5 萬公里高速鐵路連起大都會與古城，搭高鐵是旅人暢遊中國最快的方式。這是使用攻略。</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>high-speed-rail</category><category>travel-guide</category><category>cities</category></item><item><title>漢服復興：年輕中國重新穿上傳統服飾</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/culture/20260915-culture-hanfu-revival/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/culture/20260915-culture-hanfu-revival/</guid><description>城市公園裡飄逸的衣袖、漢服寫真館、數十億元人民幣的市場——中國傳統服飾已從戲服走向日常時尚。</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>hanfu</category><category>fashion</category><category>tradition</category></item></channel></rss>